---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - Constitution-भारत का संविधान">
    <section class="legal-page" style="padding-top: 120px; min-height: 100vh;">
        <div class="container reveal">
            <div class="glass-card" style="padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);">
                <header style="margin-bottom: 3rem; text-align: center;">
                    <h1 class="gradient-text">Privacy Policy</h1>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-secondary);"><strong>Effective Date:</strong> August 2, 2026</p>
                </header>

                <main class="legal-content">
                    <p>This Privacy Policy applies to the <strong>Constitution-भारत का संविधान</strong> app (hereby referred to as "Application") for mobile devices that was created as a Free service. This service is provided "AS IS".</p>

                    <h2>Information Collection and Use</h2>
                    <p>The Application is primarily an offline reference application. We do not require you to create an account, nor do we intentionally collect, store, or transmit any Personally Identifiable Information (PII) to our servers.</p>

                    <h3>Local Data Storage</h3>
                    <p>The Application uses on-device local storage to save your preferences, bookmarks, and quiz progress. This data remains strictly on your device and is not transmitted externally.</p>

                    <h3>Third-Party Services</h3>
                    <p>The Application uses third-party services that may collect information used to identify you or your device. Below is a list of the third-party service providers used by the Application and the specific reasons for their use:</p>
                    
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Google Play Services:</strong> Used for core application functionality.</li>
                        <li><strong>Google Analytics for Firebase:</strong> Used to collect aggregated, anonymous usage data such as which screens you visit and how long you spend on them. This helps us understand how users interact with the app and improve the overall user experience. No personally identifiable information is collected through this service.</li>
                        <li><strong>AdMob:</strong> Used to serve advertisements within the Application. AdMob may use advertising IDs (such as the Android Advertising ID or Apple Identifier for Advertisers) and cookies to serve personalized ads based on your interests and past usage.</li>
                    </ul>

                    <p>Links to the privacy policies of third-party service providers used by the Application:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Play Services</a></li>
                        <li><a href="https://firebase.google.com/policies/analytics" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics for Firebase</a></li>
                        <li><a href="https://support.google.com/admob/answer/6128543?hl=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">AdMob</a></li>
                    </ul>

                    <h2>Advertising and Cross-Promotion</h2>
                    <p>We use Google AdMob to display ads in the Application. Google, as a third-party vendor, uses cookies or unique device identifiers to serve ads to users based on their visit to this Application and other sites on the Internet.</p> 

                    <p><strong>Cross-Promotion:</strong> Occasionally, we may display internal promotional dialogs or advertisements for other applications developed by us (Logic Path Systems). We do not collect or share any personal data when these internal promotions are displayed. The app only tracks the number of times you have opened the app locally on your device to determine when to show these promotions.</p>

                    <p>Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting Google's <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ads Settings</a>. Alternatively, you can opt out of a third-party vendor's use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting <a href="http://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">www.aboutads.info</a>.</p>

                    <p>On your mobile device, you can also manage personalized ad tracking through your device settings:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Android:</strong> Go to Settings &gt; Google &gt; Ads &gt; Opt out of Ads Personalization (or similar, depending on your device).</li>
                        <li><strong>iOS:</strong> Go to Settings &gt; Privacy &gt; Apple Advertising and turn off Personalized Ads.</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
                    <p>The Application does not address anyone under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personally identifiable information from children under 13 years of age.</p>

                    <h2>Security</h2>
                    <p>We value your trust. Because the application operates primarily offline and does not transmit personal data to our servers, your local data is protected by your device's built-in operating system security.</p>

                    <h2>Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
                    <p>We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. Thus, you are advised to review this page periodically for any changes. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page. These changes are effective immediately after they are posted.</p>

                    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
                    <p>If you have any questions or suggestions about this Privacy Policy, do not hesitate to contact us at <strong><a href="mailto:contact@logicpathsystems.com">contact@logicpathsystems.com</a></strong>.</p>
                </main>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>

<style>
    .legal-content h2 {
        color: var(--text-primary);
        margin-top: 2.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
    }
    
    .legal-content h3 {
        color: var(--text-primary);
        margin-top: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
    }

    .legal-content p, .legal-content ul {
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .legal-content ul {
        padding-left: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .legal-content li {
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .legal-content a {
        color: var(--primary);
        text-decoration: none;
    }

    .legal-content a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
    }
</style>
